~ intro_01
N: The world is wider than most will ever truly appreciate. Wider than many will even know.
N: Full of life, spirit monsters moving through the land, bonding with our hearts, growing in the trees.
N: And the Divine Forest, the heart of that life, keeps it flowing throughout the world with the blessing of the gods enshrined there.
=> END
~ intro_02
N: A minor god dwells here: Kwerkwu, the Oaken Caribou. And his lone acolyte, a witch who lives apart from people.
N: And yet the Divine Forest…
=> END